WEBVTT

01:06:27.079 --> 01:06:32.121
Broadening the set of people able to start
companies and that sort of get

01:06:32.246 --> 01:06:33.746
the resources that you need,

01:06:34.163 --> 01:06:37.454
that is like an unequivocally good
thing and it's something that

01:06:37.454 --> 01:06:41.496
I think Silicon Valley is making some
progress in. But I hope we see a lot more.

01:06:41.496 --> 01:06:43.996
And I do really, truly think that

01:06:44.246 --> 01:06:48.496
the technology industry entrepreneurship
is one of the greatest forces for

01:06:50.204 --> 01:06:54.579
self betterment. If we can
just figure out how to be

01:06:54.579 --> 01:06:56.288
a little bit more inclusive
in how we do things.

01:06:57.371 --> 01:07:00.663
My last question today is about
ideas were spreading.